Caveat
======

The list of strategies may change in the future!

Functions with optional argument named Strategy:
================================================

  * "addHook(...,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note addHook: (Macaulay2Doc)addHook,
    -- add a hook function to an object for later processing
  * "annihilator(...,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note annihilator:
    (Saturation)annihilator, -- the annihilator ideal
  * "basis(...,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note basis: (Macaulay2Doc)basis, --
    basis or generating set of all or part of a ring, ideal or module
  * "mingens(...,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note Complement:
    (Macaulay2Doc)Complement, -- a Strategy option value
  * "trim(...,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note Complement:
    (Macaulay2Doc)Complement, -- a Strategy option value
  * "compose(Module,Module,Module,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note compose:
    (Macaulay2Doc)compose, -- composition as a pairing on Hom-modules
  * *note determinant(...,Strategy=>...):
    (Macaulay2Doc)determinant_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- choose
    between Bareiss, Cofactor and Dynamic algorithms
  * "dual(MonomialIdeal,List,Strategy=>...)" -- see *note
    dual(MonomialIdeal,Strategy=>...):
